WEBVTT

00:01.920 --> 00:03.587
To clear elder brother's name

00:04.120 --> 00:05.560
Is truly wonderful news

00:06.200 --> 00:07.280
You don't know

00:07.360 --> 00:08.040
These past few days

00:08.120 --> 00:09.920
I've been unable to eat or sleep

00:10.000 --> 00:11.960
Constantly thinking of ways to defend elder brother

00:12.120 --> 00:13.360
I came to see Father today

00:13.440 --> 00:14.560
To persuade Father

00:14.640 --> 00:16.000
To release elder brother

00:16.080 --> 00:17.480
Father has already agreed

00:24.320 --> 00:25.400
Since

00:25.480 --> 00:26.880
You've already brought him

00:27.080 --> 00:28.840
There's no reason to take him back

00:28.920 --> 00:30.480
Go report to His Majesty

00:30.560 --> 00:31.960
Miss Chen

00:33.120 --> 00:35.360
No need for Prince of Jin to remind me

00:35.440 --> 00:36.560
I'm leaving

